Its services include investment planning, retirement planning, risk planning, business needs such as group benefits for employees, estate planning, and short-term insurance advice for personal and commercial needs. The website also lists asset management, funds, and news and insights. The company says its aim is to create, preserve and maintain wealth to meet clients'' current and long-term needs. Its homepage metadata describes the firm as having more than 100 years of expertise in investment, estate and risk planning.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://fisherdugmore.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'fisher-dugmore-financial-blue-valley-golf-estate' AND description = 'Fisher Dugmore Financial is an independently owned financial services provider based in Route 21 Corporate Park, Irene, offering financial planning, wealth management, investment, risk protection, retirement planning and estate structuring services.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
